(6858113, 1031422, 60862, '<td valign="top">Good concept, good composition.  Doesn''t really grab me, though. Probably would with more contrast and having the lighting be brighter on the black head.  I also think it''d work better with the black head sharper than the rest; while I''m not normally distracted by minor stuff, the sharp ones on the left do pull my eye over there.<br/> <br/>I also struggled a bit with the title, but decided it was a wry commentary on racists, not an offensive title in itself.<br/> <br/>In a free study, I probably would''ve voted this a 4, which for me means "nice try, some quality problems and not grabbing me."  But in this challenge in particular, where people seemed to struggle to both have a solid concept and execute it, I''m voting it a 6.</td>', 'Good concept, good composition.  Doesn''t really grab me, though. Probably would with more contrast and having the lighting be brighter on the black head.  I also think it''d work better with the black head sharper than the rest; while I''m not normally distracted by minor stuff, the sharp ones on the left do pull my eye over there. I also struggled a bit with the title, but decided it was a wry commentary on racists, not an offensive title in itself. In a free study, I probably would''ve voted this a 4, which for me means "nice try, some quality problems and not grabbing me."  But in this challenge in particular, where people seemed to struggle to both have a solid concept and execute it, I''m voting it a 6.', '2012-09-06 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
