(6858852, 1031753, 96530, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lev! And taken barely a stones throw away from my office too :D<br/> <br/>I''ll give you credit for setting this up intentionally, but I have shot in that park in the same direction before and the background can get quite messy. That articulated bus was very fortunate in the background to keep the focus on your subject. So glad this did well for you.</td>', 'Congrats Lev! And taken barely a stones throw away from my office too :D I''ll give you credit for setting this up intentionally, but I have shot in that park in the same direction before and the background can get quite messy. That articulated bus was very fortunate in the background to keep the focus on your subject. So glad this did well for you.', '2012-09-07 01:16:07.000000', NULL, 0),
