(6859351, 1031745, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7. I love the capture but I will admit I was distracted by the intense distortion of the wide-angle... the "fisheye" look. I think it overwhelms the shot a bit. But that might just be my bias. It''s a great shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I gave you a 7. I love the capture but I will admit I was distracted by the intense distortion of the wide-angle... the "fisheye" look. I think it overwhelms the shot a bit. But that might just be my bias. It''s a great shot nonetheless.', '2012-09-07 14:00:11.000000', NULL, 0),
